  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened rehabilitation/healthcare personnel capacity, School-aged children with disabilities with enhanced daily living skills, Local health centers with strengthened support capabilities for children with disabilities, Local communities with promoted advocacy and improved awareness activities</narrative>
  </description>
